{
  "feature": "Collection screens PRs 2 and 3: the Add cards sheet (add mode), the place head's + Add, the empty-state doors and Home step one",
  "note": "Needs COLLECTION_EDIT_ENABLED=true on the server and a collection with Sol Ring in the catalog (any account with cards). Deliberately no saving, saved or failed rows: a saved state writes a ledger entry to whatever database the app points at, and the three are covered by add-cards-sheet.test.tsx. The History tab and B8's History link draw only once /collection/history ships (PR 6), so no row has them. Steps are Playwright verbs. The doors rows (`doors-empty`, `doors-add`, `home-add-by-hand`) need an account with NO collection; every other row needs one with cards.",
  "shares": {
    "module": "src/components/collection/add-cards-sheet.tsx",
    "binding": "AddCardsSheet",
    "note": "The place head mounts the sheet directly, so each row's `view` is the head. PR 7 adds the card modal's Edit copies host as a second view when it mounts the same sheet in edit mode."
  },
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "place-head",
      "label": "/collection: the head with + Add, strip at y 109",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/collection",
          "wait": "main, [role=main], h1",
          "settle": 6000
        }
      ],
      "view": "src/components/collection/collection-place-head.tsx"
    },
    {
      "id": "add-empty",
      "label": "Add cards: the empty sheet (side sheet at 1300, full height at 390, upload line on the phone)",
      "view": "src/components/collection/collection-place-head.tsx",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/collection",
          "wait": "main, [role=main], h1",
          "settle": 6000
        },
        {
          "clickRole": "button",
          "name": "^(\\+\\s*)?Add( cards)?$",
          "wait": "[role=dialog]",
          "settle": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
